ong>Supabase</strong> (Suscripción Básica / Pro Base)</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">$25.00</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">5 meses</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">$125.00</th></tr><tr><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>TOTAL ESCENARIO B</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>$54.99 / mes</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>5 meses</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>$274.95</strong></th></tr></table>
